    </p>
    <a href="#register" class="we-hero-cta">
      Register for the workshop <i class="ph-light ph-arrow-right"></i>
    </a>
    <a href="#workshop" class="we-hero-link">See the next date &amp; details</a>
    <div class="we-hero-meta">
      <span>With Jacob Vermeulen</span>
      <span class="dot"></span>
